{"unit_id":"ITroyeSivan__Saker#card-zh","repo":"ITroyeSivan/Saker","commit":"7341cb33fd528f9f265dd4287d4c808b06026b84","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**Saker**（DSH Desktop 插件，桌面与 Web 会话界面）：把测试模式、项目案例检查和 CTF 工作接入 DeepSeek Harness。它注册 pentest、code-audit、ctf-solver 预设及共享技能；随附工具支持浏览器操作、材料检索、逐项检查、成果记录和赛题命令。适合需要在一个会话中整理资料并推进检查的测试人员。需要 Windows 10/11、Node.js 24.9+ 和官方 DeepSeek Harness Desktop；模型及外部工具按需配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/preset-root.js:64-90","lib/skill-registry.js:5-10","plugins/dsh-redteam-results/lib/index.js:2378-2440","plugins/dsh-redteam-results/lib/index.js:3476-3545","plugins/dsh-redteam-results/lib/index.js:3868-3944"]}
